	(text "Sonar v1 - Digital sheet (T-011, D012): Cmod A7-35T DIP-48 socket, FT232H sync-FIFO header, generic PDM header, DNP RMII provision, TX control, test points."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "beed44c2-8852-4702-b040-7908ed3df3ec")
	)
	(text "AUTHORITATIVE PIN TABLE: orchestration/pinmap.md (generated by scripts/gen_digital_sheet.py).\nClock-capable pins: PDM_CLK_FB=pio36 (MRCC), FT_CLKOUT=pio43 (SRCC), ETH_REF_CLK=pio3 (MRCC) - all double-sourced.\nPackage pins are offline transcriptions of the Digilent Cmod-A7-Master.xdc - audit against the live master XDC before T-020 synthesis."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 18.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bfda9535-3d56-424d-a2d9-4f858f701c61")
	)
	(text "POWER STRATEGY (decided, T-011): the Cmod A7 powers itself from its own micro-USB. The board does not power the module and the\nmodule does not power the board: CMOD_3V3 / CMOD_VU default to no-connect. SJ1/SJ2 are DNP solder-jumper rework options\n(SJ1: module 3V3 <-> board +3.3V; SJ2: module VU <-> board 5V - fit only with T-012 review, never as a paralleled-regulator hack).\nGrounds are common through the socket GND pins. The FT232H breakout is self-powered from its own USB (its 5V pin is NC).\nBoard +3.3V rail source: T-012 power tree (do not confuse with the legacy \"3.3V\" net of the old analog tree)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3ecd3a12-cec2-4f6d-9034-bcc23ffcd974")
	)
	(text "PDM HEADER CONTENTION RULE (D012): exactly ONE capture platform attached at a time - either the Cmod A7 in socket J40,\nor the Pico 2 (T-009) via ribbon on J42. NEVER both: both would drive PDM_CLK_SRC/PDM_CLK_EN into each other.\nMicrophones and the CDCLVC1112 clock buffer live on the array sheet (T-010/T-016); PDM_* nets cross sheets by global label."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 42.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2666f347-8621-42ac-80bd-014ddce6490d")
	)
	(text "TX control nets (TX_EN/TX_PH/TX_NSLEEP/TX_NFAULT/TX_PMODE) leave this sheet by global label to the TX h-bridge sheet (T-013).\nTX_NFAULT is open-drain: pull-up belongs on the TX sheet. Debug LEDs: use on-module Cmod LEDs (led0/led1/RGB) - see pinmap.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dd873d51-e30c-4132-b719-ef5a57712036")
	)
